  "body": "Whether you are seeking your first home or looking to downsize, this spacious two-bedroom home on a private freehold section is packed with surprises! \r\n\r\nThis hidden sanctuary feels worlds away from the daily busyness, greeting you with birdsong, native bush, and sweeping panoramic views across Manly the moment you arrive. \r\n\r\nInside, warm, sun-drenched open-plan living connects effortlessly to dining and outdoor entertaining. Sliders lead straight to an expansive deck that floats above the greenery, a setting for relaxed weekend barbecues, morning coffees in the sun, and quiet evenings watching the sun shift across the horizon.\r\n\r\n The overall layout is practical and well-balanced, with two good-sized, sunlit bedrooms served by a central bathroom, a standalone toilet for busy mornings, and an independent laundry that leads to a private sunny courtyard.\r\n\r\nSeparate to the home, the substantial double garage has a versatile bonus room with its own private toilet. Whether you envision a focused work-from-home office, a dedicated fitness studio, workshop or space for creative projects, this adaptable setup caters effortlessly to modern lifestyles, with plenty of off-street parking left over for visitors, a trailer, or a boat.\r\n\r\nFor all its quiet seclusion, daily convenience remains effortless. Morning school runs to Whangaparaoa College and the local primary school are a short walk, while Coast Plaza, local eateries, and the peninsula's stunning beaches are all right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThis is where quintessential coastal living, work-from-home flexibility, and private natural beauty come together in complete harmony.",
